  {
    "label": "9fbd67f9-88e1-5554-8625-84ac1e940645",
    "record": {
      "knowledge_point": {
        "db_id": 17592186087866,
        "id": "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a",
        "title": "Writing First-Order Linear ODEs in Standard Form"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "9fbd67f9-88e1-5554-8625-84ac1e940645",
        ":question/problem": "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2x-y}{x}\\,.\n$$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{2x-y}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{2x}{x}-\\frac{y}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & +\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac{2x}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & +{{\\frac{1}{x}}_{\u23df}}_{P(x)}y={{2}_{\u23df}}_{Q(x)}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=\\frac{1}{x}$ and $Q(x)=2.$",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
            ":answer-field/id": "57ee4a69-5c37-5b5b-9d83-fd6eb1f2f193",
            ":answer-field/key": "selection",
            ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
            ":answer-field/correct": [
              ":answer/id",
              "e907ba10-aa76-5dbf-bb32-8f9829e3aeb9"
            ],
            ":answer-field/choices": [
              {
                ":answer/id": "19d75fc4-d565-5247-a3d2-0dd1d71481b2",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\frac{1}{x}y-2=0"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "e907ba10-aa76-5dbf-bb32-8f9829e3aeb9",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\frac{1}{x}y=2"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "a15aa42d-fc0c-537c-988d-61613c47dc74",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-\\frac{1}{x}y+2"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "33f582cb-d125-5a7e-bc13-6fd636ea22e2",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+y=2x"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "0d56ade3-8c2b-558b-8dee-d6c16408ae98",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "y=2x-x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
