  {
    "label": "f284d9d4-47c8-54c3-aa2b-11e7ba22d40f",
    "record": {
      "knowledge_point": {
        "db_id": 17592186087866,
        "id": "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a",
        "title": "Writing First-Order Linear ODEs in Standard Form"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "f284d9d4-47c8-54c3-aa2b-11e7ba22d40f",
        ":question/problem": "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n(\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x+y}{x}\\,.\n$$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "A first order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x)\\,,\n$$\n\nwhere $P(x)$ and $Q(x)$ do not depend on $y.$\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{x+y}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={x}^{2}(\\frac{x+y}{x}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x(x+y) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={x}^{2}+xy \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,+{{(-x)}_{\u23df}}_{P(x)}y & ={{{x}^{2}}_{\u23df}}_{Q(x)} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-xy & ={x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=-x$ and $Q(x)={x}^{2}.$",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
            ":answer-field/id": "74ddf3aa-733e-5972-8973-46d76ff540e6",
            ":answer-field/key": "selection",
            ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
            ":answer-field/correct": [
              ":answer/id",
              "71040d28-62bb-5d78-b4e6-2a190574112e"
            ],
            ":answer-field/choices": [
              {
                ":answer/id": "d895b1af-8150-5cb7-9f48-017f2ef90f34",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+xy=\\frac{1}{x}"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "5a9afd84-fe8c-56a0-89e1-00f6ac764479",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-(1+x)y=0"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "0646fdce-fd3c-56a7-8137-632d215be116",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-xy=2x"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "71040d28-62bb-5d78-b4e6-2a190574112e",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-xy={x}^{2}"
